# Build-context filter for edge.Dockerfile (BuildKit picks up <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# Context = restaurant-vision/. edge/models/*.onnx is kept on purpose: a verified local model
# saves the download.
*
!contracts/
!edge/
!simulator/
!web/
!deploy/edge/edge.example.yaml
edge/tests
edge/var
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite
**/*.db
**/.env
**/*.tsbuildinfo
